{ Welcome friends to my study ' Crush the Caro-Kann Defense with the Alien Gambit '!!. Alien Gambit is made by Witty Alien. There is also an Alien Gambit Bonjour Variation against the French Defense. Martian Gambit against the Caro-Kann.

Alien Gambit can be only against the Caro-Kann Defense. Our ambition is to sacrifice our Knight on f7..CAN WE BECOME THE BEST STUDY IN LICHESS FOR ALIEN GAMBIT!!.

Let's start play e4 to initiate the Alian Gambit!! }
1. e4 { Alian Gambit can be only played with e4 against the Caro-Kann defense. } (1. d4) (1. c4) 1... c6 { We will play d4 to control the centre. } 2. d4 d5 { We are going to play Nd2 to protect our pawn on e4 and to start the journey of our Knight!! } { [%cal Gb1c3,Gb1d2,Gc3e4,Gg5f7,Gd2e4,Ge4g5] } 3. Nd2 dxe4 { If dxe4 then Nxe4. One more thing if the d pawn of black doesn't takes our pawn we would be not able to play the Alien Gambit. } 4. Nxe4 { Capturing with the Knight and its journey has started!! } 4... Nf6 { We will not take the Knight and go on g5. } { [%cal Ge4g5,Gg5f7] } 5. Ng5 { Do not take the Knight and go on g5. } 5... h6 { h6 is the most natural move in this position and has been played in 300,000+ games, giving a winrate of 56 %. It's time to sacrifice the Knight on f7. } 6. Nxf7!! { Sacrifice the Knight on f7 and its journey has ended!! The move has been played in 150,000+ games giving a winrate of 60%. Is it a BLUNDER or a BRILLIANT move? } *


