{ This trap has been played by GM Hikaru Nakamura and he defeated a FM with this trap.. So let's start.. }
1. e4 c6 { Here were not going to play d4 instead we will play Nc3. } 2. Nc3 (2. d4 { Come on brother, see properly what is given on the previous move. }) 2... d5 { Now we will play Nf3. } 3. Nf3 (3. d4 { Again brother, see properly what is given on the previous move. }) 3... dxe4 { Capture the pawn.. } 4. Nxe4 Nf6 { Now you know what to do.. } 5. Neg5 h6 { Sacrifice thaaa Knight!! } 6. Nxf7!! Kxf7 { Give a check by the Knight.. } 7. Ne5+ { [%cal Gf7e6,Gf7e8,Gf7g8] } 7... Ke8? { Play Bd3 threating a checkmate. } 8. Bd3 { [%csl Gg6][%cal Gd3g6] } (8. Bc4?? { This move is BLUNDER, black gets an advantage of -1.3.As now black has Qd4! double attack on our pieces. Instead play Bd3. Giving us an advantage of +1.0. } { [%csl Gf7,Gd4,Gc4,Ge5][%cal Gc4f7,Gd8d4,Gd4c4,Gd4e5] }) 8... Be6?? { Deliver the CHECKMATE..Here Hikaru's opponent got trapped.. } 9. Bg6+! Bf7 { Can you find the MATE ? } 10. Bxf7#! *


[Event "Crush the Caro-Kann Defense with the Alien Gambit!!: 📔CHECKMATE:-Trap-5; Brilliant Bishop sacrifice on h6."]
